Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.89,0:00:19.40,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What does it mean to be able to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:31.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Everyone says my eyes can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:36.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What does it mean to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.41,0:00:38.39,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.51,0:00:43.89,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,To be able to perceive colors and shapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:48.40,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Colors? Shapes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.25,0:00:54.33,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,But your eyes bear the Hero's Scar \Nleft by the Holy Knight Histor Hughlia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.97,0:00:57.00,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,And that's extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.13,0:00:59.66,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,You should be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.91,0:01:01.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:06.42,main,MAID 1,0,0,0,,I know he the Hero's Scar, \Nbut I feel sorry for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.29,0:01:09.10,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Feel sorry for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:10.69,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.63,0:01:15.80,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Because I can't see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.12,0:01:21.68,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, Miss Jenié is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.03,0:01:34.19,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Do I really have to study magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.43,0:01:37.91,main,IKO,0,0,0,,It'd be a waste not to, \Nsince you were born with a water crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.91,0:01:40.95,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Being able to use magic is an amazing thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.56,0:01:47.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Even if I could use it, I still can't go\N anywhere without someone's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.15,0:01:50.76,main,IKO,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.06,0:01:56.97,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Master Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:02:02.28,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I am Jenié Kors, and I will be \Nyour magic tutor starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.56,0:02:06.75,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.51,0:02:13.44,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Yes! You're doing great, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:16.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What kind of magic am I using?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:19.16,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,It's a water spell, "A-ori."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.16,0:02:22.39,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,You're producing water using magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.39,0:02:26.52,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,It's about... the size of an eyeball.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:28.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,An eyeball?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:33.00,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:36.31,main - top,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I thought an analogy might \Nhelp you understand better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.07,0:02:35.89,main - italics,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's about this size.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.63,0:02:37.76,main - italics,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:42.98,main - italics,KUNON,0,0,0,,Then I might be able to\N create them with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.76,0:02:46.45,main - italics,KUNON,0,0,0,,I just have to make them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.57,0:02:49.02,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Master Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:53.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Come what may, I'll make\Nmy own eyes with magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:34.02,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE WORLD IN COLORS
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:45.65,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.17,0:04:49.80,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I never thought anything of it before, \Nbut now I can't help but be curious about
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:51.33,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,what's in this sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:54.44,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Everything feels intriguing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:58.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What is this fresh, grass-like thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.98,0:05:00.73,main,IKO,0,0,0,,That's lettuce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:02.07,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Lettuce?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.52,0:05:03.86,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:05.11,main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's mustard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:11.34,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh, that's—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.34,0:05:12.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I know apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:15.00,main,IKO,0,0,0,,You may think that, \Nbut it's actually a plum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.27,0:05:18.75,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A plum? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.75,0:05:23.76,main,IKO,0,0,0,,You're interested in different foods now,\N so it feels rewarding to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:29.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm now interested in what\N kind of food I'm eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:33.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But... I'm smelling too many scents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:35.77,main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's truly been so rewarding to cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:37.94,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Now, guess what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:39.61,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Can you tell what it is, Master Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:41.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'll tell them to cut your pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.65,0:05:44.49,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Sorry, I went too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.77,0:05:47.36,main,FLORA,0,0,0,,Hello, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.67,0:05:50.23,main,FLORA,0,0,0,,Which book shall I read you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:51.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Lady Flora.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:52.12,main,FLORA,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.79,0:05:53.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,History, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:57.46,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear the story of \Nthe Holy Knight Histor Hughlia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:05:58.41,main,FLORA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.99,0:06:05.46,main,FLORA,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:09.18,main,FLORA,0,0,0,,If it becomes too much for you to hear,\N please let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:10.80,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:14.50,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm thirsty for all kinds \Nof knowledge right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:20.63,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,A long, long time ago, there was a war between \Nthe heroes of the world and the Demon Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:22.27,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:31.94,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,The hero of this nation, Histor Hughlia, \Nfinally defeated the Demon Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:35.63,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,but he lost an arm and a \Nleg in the fierce battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.39,0:06:39.87,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Since the war, every now and then\Nthe descendants of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:42.81,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Histor are born with something missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.26,0:06:47.43,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,such as an arm, a leg, or eyesight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.77,0:06:48.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:56.43,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,People have called such children\Nreincarnations of the hero, the "Hero's Scar."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:07:00.99,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,But I am me, and this is my own magical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.54,0:07:05.46,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:08.83,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Nice, Master Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:10.03,main,IKO,0,0,0,,They've got a great shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:13.14,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Using my power, I can cast magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:16.67,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,And with my magic, I will make eyeballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:22.85,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Who do we have here? \NAn exceptional sorcerer of our times?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.59,0:07:25.82,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I will make it happen at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:32.59,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.07,0:07:36.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:37.19,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:41.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I need more. So much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:43.69,main,IKO,0,0,0,,What? You need more affection from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.69,0:07:45.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I think I have enough of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.69,0:07:48.89,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Showering you with\Nlimitless affection has paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:51.97,main,IKO,0,0,0,,If that wasn't enough, the only \Nthing left was to co-sleep with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:53.11,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.11,0:07:54.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.11,0:07:57.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I need way more knowledge and stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.97,0:08:00.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,They're necessary for strong magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.59,0:08:03.32,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, you're still seven \Nyears old and don't eat much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.32,0:08:04.70,main,IKO,0,0,0,,You'll grow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.66,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But that'll be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:11.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Passing out from using basic \Nmagic is out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:16.21,main,IKO,0,0,0,,But suddenly increasing your \Nfood intake will be bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.21,0:08:18.26,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Let's do it in phases.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:19.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:21.30,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And I want to strengthen my muscles,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.61,0:08:24.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,but I'm not good at running or walking...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.95,0:08:27.77,main,IKO,0,0,0,,How about sword practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.18,0:08:29.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Sword practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:32.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Right, I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.53,0:08:35.64,main,IKO,0,0,0,,While we're at it, why don't we \Nfind you an accomplished teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:37.56,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'll go speak with Lord Gurion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.56,0:08:38.16,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Iko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:39.41,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.78,0:08:41.19,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:44.89,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, one more push!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:46.92,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'd love a raise as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:49.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Iko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:50.29,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:52.81,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You were too loud during magic training.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:55.14,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Good! So you could hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:58.26,main,IKO,0,0,0,,If you kept ignoring me, I would \Nhave cried myself to sleep tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:02.26,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I should have let you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:10.48,main,OURO,0,0,0,,That's right. Pay attention to the \Nmuscles of the arms and shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:13.55,main,OURO,0,0,0,,Swing down in the order of \Nshoulders, elbows, then wrists.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.55,0:09:14.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.39,0:09:21.33,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, Miss Jenié is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:25.15,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hello, Miss Jenié.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:27.58,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Hello, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.58,0:09:30.94,main,OURO,0,0,0,,Oh, it's time for your next lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.94,0:09:33.92,main,OURO,0,0,0,,I shall excuse myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.47,0:09:36.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Master Ouro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.90,0:09:41.18,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,So you've begun learning swordplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.18,0:09:45.68,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. To use magic, \NI need knowledge and stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.33,0:09:50.65,main - italics,JENIÉ/I,0,0,0,,This boy has really changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:52.32,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Miss Jenié?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.39,0:09:55.49,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Would you like a short break?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:57.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,No, thank you. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:03.29,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Then let us review A-ori from the last lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:05.94,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,You can begin with what you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.94,0:10:07.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.37,0:10:10.41,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.41,0:10:12.13,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, you're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:19.30,main - italics,JENIÉ/I,0,0,0,,I've only taught him a little, \Nbut he's mastered this much on his own?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.30,0:10:20.76,main - italics,JENIÉ/I,0,0,0,,This boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:23.16,main - italics,JENIÉ/I,0,0,0,,He's frightening!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:31.10,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,Princess Mirika, your carriage is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.41,0:10:34.16,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Do I really have to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.16,0:10:37.49,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,Do you hate the idea of visiting \Nyour fiancé that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:40.87,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I'm sure Kunon feels the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:43.49,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,He always looks gloomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.49,0:10:46.24,main,LAURA,0,0,0,,But this is His Majesty's decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:59.95,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,Kunon was born with the Hero's Scar and is an \Nimportant person to the Kingdom of Hughlia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.54,0:11:05.01,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,I know that this political marriage \Nis part of my obligation as royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.49,0:11:09.35,main - flashback,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,What do you like, Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.57,0:11:11.48,main - flashback,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,What shall we play?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.24,0:11:14.25,main - flashback,KUNON,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.14,0:11:16.12,main - flashback,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:22.73,main - flashback,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can't do anything or go \Nanywhere alone, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.53,0:11:36.63,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Having to look at that gloomy \Nface for the rest of my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:39.76,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:40.50,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.33,0:11:42.44,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.44,0:11:43.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:47.48,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Princess Mirika is as cute as ever today!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:51.78,main,IKO,0,0,0,,If I were a massive, bearded, middle-aged man,\N I wouldn't leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.78,0:11:53.69,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Your hypothetical kind of scares me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:56.68,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,No, that's not what caught my attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:58.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.10,0:12:00.69,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,That's what I was going to ask you, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:03.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. I fell in love with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.72,0:12:06.95,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.49,0:12:08.59,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:11.46,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:14.96,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,It's water. Very beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:24.57,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Wow! That's amazing, Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.57,0:12:25.79,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:26.72,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:30.97,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to have made you \Ntread lightly around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:34.41,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Oh, no need to apologize...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.26,0:12:38.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Will you listen to my stories today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.19,0:12:41.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I've done a lot of fun things lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:47.10,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,I didn't know he could make a face like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.30,0:12:50.03,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.44,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,That was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:08.84,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,See you soon, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:16.13,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever offered \Nmy hand to her before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:19.48,main,IKO,0,0,0,,That's because you're a true gentleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.48,0:13:20.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Gentleman?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.33,0:13:25.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'd like you to teach me how to \Nbehave around Princess Mirika.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.39,0:13:28.20,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So that I can be a gentleman \Nwho is worthy of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:29.81,main,FLORA,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:32.45,main,FLORA,0,0,0,,Let us go over the poise \Nand manners of a noble—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:36.00,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes! And why not make him a \Ngentleman with a sense of humor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.81,0:13:45.01,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:48.76,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Creating seven beautiful \Nwater balls simultaneously...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.99,0:13:51.00,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Even I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:54.52,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I mean, he's literally perfected \Nthe elementary magic already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:56.98,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,He's learning too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.30,0:14:00.49,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can teach him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:04.79,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Then we move on to the intermediate magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.79,0:14:05.78,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,No, we can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:07.85,main,NEIGHBOR,0,0,0,,Hey! Quiet please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.85,0:14:10.05,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.65,0:14:13.85,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,This was supposed to be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:18.92,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,a sweet gig getting paid handsomely\Nto teach elementary magic to a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.78,0:14:23.55,main - italics,JENIÉ/I,0,0,0,,While magic is convenient, \Nit's not necessarily safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:28.41,main - italics,JENIÉ/I,0,0,0,,It's too soon for the seven-year-old Master \NKunon to learn sophisticated magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:31.97,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,But it's too soon to give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:33.33,main,NEIGHBOR,0,0,0,,Quiet, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:36.11,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:40.99,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I won't give up on this job! \NI've got bills to pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:44.65,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Let us try something different today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:49.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Of course. Hearing it in your beautiful \Nvoice, I can accept anything you have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.17,0:14:51.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Please go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.15,0:14:54.20,main - italics,JENIÉ/I,0,0,0,,He's changed yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:15:01.76,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,The A-ori spell you've been \Nusing simply creates water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.76,0:15:05.00,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Now, let's break down the magic involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:08.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Does that mean separating producing \Nwater, making water float,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.55,0:15:11.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,and maintaining the ball shape of the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.82,0:15:13.18,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:17.99,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,We can break it down even further if we \Nthink about the temperature, viscosity,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.99,0:15:21.06,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,composition, color, shape, \Nsheen, scent, and taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:25.21,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,There can be a wide variety of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:26.23,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.31,0:15:30.35,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,I have produced two water balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.35,0:15:32.01,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Please touch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:32.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:36.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.42,0:15:38.11,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And this one's warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.11,0:15:39.58,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:44.58,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Magical alterations add character to magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.80,0:15:46.59,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Character?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:52.22,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,That's what clearly defines and differentiates \Neach sorcerer and their talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.55,0:15:57.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,One becomes capable of altering \Nfine details of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:03.19,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:09.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Iko, try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:12.06,main,IKO,0,0,0,,If I may...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.01,0:16:17.78,main,IKO,0,0,0,,This is... an apple flavor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:19.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You may think that, but it's plum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.78,0:16:21.45,main,IKO,0,0,0,,What? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.45,0:16:24.46,main,IKO,0,0,0,,But I can taste it. It goes down nicely!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:28.46,main - italics,JENIÉ/I,0,0,0,,Can you not immediately master the magic \Nalteration I stayed up all night to come up with?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:30.96,main,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,S-Seems like you can do them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.13,0:16:34.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Well, it's a bit challenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.82,0:16:38.59,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But I promise I'll do them all, Miss Jenié.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:44.54,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can tell the shapes and scents,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.87,0:16:48.22,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,but I don't know the colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:53.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But if I don't, I can't create magical \Nalterations nor create eyeballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.67,0:16:59.86,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'll get it done. I want to \Nsee everything in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.89,0:17:07.48,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, what would you like to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:09.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Milk tea with no milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.53,0:17:11.38,main,IKO,0,0,0,,May I please have some hot water?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:11.92,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:13.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.07,0:17:17.70,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Magic is truly a wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.70,0:17:21.43,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Seen by someone with no magic, \Nit's like a divine miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:24.33,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.33,0:17:25.19,main,IKO,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:32.32,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I think I... saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:33.19,main,IKO,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:34.32,main,IKO,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:37.57,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Do you mean that?! If it's a lie, \NI'll have to smack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:38.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hold on, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.65,0:17:41.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I don't know. I don't know either!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:43.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And technically, I don't think I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:47.08,main - top,IKO,0,0,0,,I'd love for you to be a gentleman \Nwith a sense of humor,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:48.78,main - top,IKO,0,0,0,,but please don't tell tasteless jokes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.78,0:17:50.68,main - top,IKO,0,0,0,,Or else I'm going to have to kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:50.96,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,No, hear me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:54.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It feels like I saw colors, or more \Nlike I felt them with my magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.85,0:17:56.97,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is this thing red?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.97,0:17:58.89,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:00.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Then this one is red?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.77,0:18:01.85,main,IKO,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.85,0:18:05.98,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I see. Colors and their names \Ndon't correspond for you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.98,0:18:08.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yeah, because I've never seen them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.18,0:18:10.99,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Anyhow, that was out of the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.99,0:18:13.12,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Blue? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.12,0:18:15.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This apple is green. Stop confusing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:17.90,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm saying there are idioms with colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.90,0:18:20.37,main,IKO,0,0,0,,And can you tell how many apples there are?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.81,0:18:24.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Three red apples and two green apples, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.62,0:18:25.65,main,IKO,0,0,0,,That's correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.65,0:18:26.92,main,IKO,0,0,0,,This is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:30.00,main,IKO,0,0,0,,It really is like a divine miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.75,0:18:33.50,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,He can see colors?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.82,0:18:39.00,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Only in a small range, but he seems \Nto be able to recognize colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.46,0:18:41.08,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Kunon can finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:45.35,main,IKO,0,0,0,,The closer an item is, the clearer it is, and \Nhe can tell the color when he touches them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.17,0:18:49.73,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Does that mean he can read books?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.73,0:18:53.86,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yes, he can trace the ink \Nto recognize the colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.22,0:18:58.61,main,IKO,0,0,0,,He hasn't learned letters yet, but he's \Nabsorbed in picture books and encyclopedias.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.67,0:19:00.74,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.30,0:19:07.35,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Why don't you come back to the main house?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.35,0:19:11.01,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,You moved out since Kunon didn't \Nwant to be a bother for the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.01,0:19:14.88,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,and my wife had to tend to \Nhim nonstop, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.88,0:19:16.01,main,IKO,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:20.76,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon is trying to change drastically.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:22.64,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Every day is a struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:28.52,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Changing his environment now might hinder \NMaster Kunon from achieving his goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.52,0:19:29.90,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:33.79,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Well, it's close enough that \NI can see him anytime I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:36.77,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to put you in a position to \Ntake care of Kunon all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:37.95,main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.95,0:19:39.65,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I love working for money!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.65,0:19:43.93,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Your cheerfulness might have \Na positive effect on my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.68,0:19:46.55,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Rather than a compliment...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.99,0:19:49.17,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'd love a raise instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.23,0:19:53.67,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Experimenting already, Master Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.91,0:19:58.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Miss Jenié will be here soon, \Nso I'd like it to surprise her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.55,0:20:00.84,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Then let's go all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.13,0:20:03.59,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's my plan. A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.87,0:20:07.81,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Wonderful, Master Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.81,0:20:10.56,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Beautiful red, like the eyes of a white rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:13.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,When I make them bigger,\N I sense the color more strongly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.20,0:20:17.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So this is red.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.67,0:20:18.68,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.11,0:20:23.61,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,I heard the news. You can see colors now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.61,0:20:28.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That exquisite voice like the song \Nof a bird belongs to my dear mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.38,0:20:33.23,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:38.63,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.63,0:20:40.26,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:42.32,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Mother! Pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:44.51,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,How could you do such a horrific thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:46.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Horrific?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.33,0:20:50.21,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, red is also the \Ncolor of human blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.21,0:20:52.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, blood is red?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:54.13,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,As a punishment, no allowance for two months!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.13,0:20:56.52,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Iko, your pay will be cut for three months!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:57.30,main,IKO,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.30,0:20:58.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.33,0:20:59.75,main,IKO,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.15,0:21:02.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Iko! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:04.95,main - top,ARSAN,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.95,0:21:07.49,main - top,ARSAN,0,0,0,,You're smeared in blood! \NStanding in the pool of blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:11.79,main - top,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Think of your mother! We need \Nto be gentle with her...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:07.49,main - italics,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,He's truly frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:10.99,main - italics,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,How far will this boy go, climbing the ladder?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:13.34,main - italics,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,Perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.38,0:21:19.24,main - italics,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,He may be able to earn the title \Nof highest honor in this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.24,0:21:21.05,main - italics,JENIÉ,0,0,0,,"Cerulean Sorcerer."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.18,0:23:00.97,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, new materials have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.12,0:23:06.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you. You can leave them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.75,0:23:11.67,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,He's turned nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.69,0:23:18.96,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,We need to start thinking about his schooling.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.89,0:23:38.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Next episode: "To the School \Nfor Noble Children."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.20,0:23:40.25,main - top,SIGN {left top},0,0,0,,NEXT EPISODE: \NTO THE SCHOOL FOR NOBLE CHILDREN
